        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We keep personal data only for as long as necessary for the purposes described in this Policy, including to maintain your account, provide the Services, resolve disputes, enforce agreements, and meet legal, tax, accounting, or fraud-prevention obligations. Routine backups may retain limited data for a limited period before deletion. We cannot erase information stored on a public or immutable blockchain that is outside our control."
